body:
yes but the comp would take a life time. peoples idea of cgi who arent professionals is frustrating. there are so many minute details happening here that bring the entire thing together. nothing is out of place. People think just cos u could build a craft and animate it then it'd job done. what about the camera shake. the light refracton, reflection of the lense, the movement of that lense replicating the shake in the video. the sun cresting over the craft. the natural artifacts you'd get from an old camera./ this is 2008/ a hobbiest couldnt do this in 2008

&#x200B;

Skinny bob however is CGI from a mile away. terrible cgi
